{"ID":"20251031162656-7mel3ue","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20251031162656-7mel3ue","title":"UPL7-7——刚体相关","type":"doc","updated":"20251031172750"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031162656-mxh2d7l","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20251031162656-mxh2d7l","updated":"20251031172341"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20251031163005-9u2zwzd","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"fold":"1","id":"20251031163005-9u2zwzd","updated":"20251031164242"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"知识回顾：碰撞体、刚体、运动学刚体、碰撞检测类型"}]},{"ID":"20251031163331-6clm3af","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251031163331-6clm3af","updated":"20251031163349"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"详细可见："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20230709204605-cxhobun","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"d","TextMarkTextContent":"U1L13——物理系统碰撞体相关"}]},{"ID":"20251031163025-imoygnj","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251031163025-imoygnj","updated":"20251031163032"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031163032-52p1kow","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251031163032-52p1kow","updated":"20251031163032"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031163032-fhrc25i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251031163032-fhrc25i","updated":"20251031163032"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"碰撞体："}]},{"ID":"20251031163111-444ut6o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251031163111-444ut6o","updated":"20251031163111"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对于不移动的物体，但是需要和物理对象产生碰撞的物体\n只需要加碰撞体组件，因为它不需要有受力表现，只希望阻挡其他物理对象\n我们一般称只带有碰撞器的对象为 静态碰撞体"}]}]},{"ID":"20251031163035-35cpgbk","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251031163035-35cpgbk","updated":"20251031163035"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031163035-il1iwby","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251031163035-il1iwby","updated":"20251031163035"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"刚体："}]},{"ID":"20251031163104-f0ihe2i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251031163104-f0ihe2i","updated":"20251031163106"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"要移动，并且需要有物理受力表现的物体，需要添加碰撞器和刚体\n我们一般称带刚体和碰撞器的对象为 动态碰撞体"}]}]},{"ID":"20251031163038-rqem2sr","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251031163038-rqem2sr","updated":"20251031163038"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031163038-hl51p3n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251031163038-hl51p3n","updated":"20251031163042"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"运动学刚体："}]},{"ID":"20251031163044-ce8qo8g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251031163044-ce8qo8g","updated":"20251031163049"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"刚体上勾选了 是运动学的（Is Kinematic）选项的刚体称为运动学刚体\n它的作用类似 静态碰撞体 的效果，即与其它对象产生碰撞时，自身不会有力作用表现"}]},{"ID":"20251031163054-kghy8ye","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251031163054-kghy8ye","updated":"20251031163059"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"好处是我们可以利用刚体相关 API 让其移动，由于运动学刚体对象不会对撞击它的对象做出物理反应\n它在运行时会简单的把其他动态碰撞器推开，因此，有时我们会在某些类型的游戏中将玩家对象设置为运动学刚体"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251031163121-3dgae4f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251031163121-3dgae4f","updated":"20251031164242"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"碰撞检测类型（Collision Detection）："}]},{"ID":"20251031163137-k78ef5a","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251031163137-k78ef5a","updated":"20251031163137"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031163137-peehyzf","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251031163137-peehyzf","updated":"20251031163137"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031163025-1ic459q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251031163025-1ic459q","updated":"20251031163025"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Discrete（离散检测）"}]},{"ID":"20251031163141-adwwnxu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251031163141-adwwnxu","updated":"20251031163144"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原理：每个物体只在 固定物理步长的采样点 检查是否与其他碰撞体重叠"}]},{"ID":"20251031163144-uckw6o6","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251031163144-uckw6o6","updated":"20251031163144"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031163144-g8cg2m8","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251031163144-g8cg2m8","updated":"20251031163144"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031163144-ks63mtj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251031163144-ks63mtj","updated":"20251031163144"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"优点：性能最好，开销最小"}]}]},{"ID":"20251031163145-35marc3","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251031163145-35marc3","updated":"20251031163145"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031163145-iz1u7op","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251031163145-iz1u7op","updated":"20251031163145"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"缺点：高速小物体可能在两帧之间跳过另一个碰撞体,出现穿透现象"}]}]},{"ID":"20251031163146-umkldjx","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251031163146-umkldjx","updated":"20251031163146"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031163146-4xbreng","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251031163146-4xbreng","updated":"20251031163146"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"适用场景：绝大多数常速移动的物体（角色、箱子、环境物件）"}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251031163137-ih10rl2","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251031163137-ih10rl2","updated":"20251031163137"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031163025-e3n6kn0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251031163025-e3n6kn0","updated":"20251031163025"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Continuous（连续检测）"}]},{"ID":"20251031163149-1ri7fdx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251031163149-1ri7fdx","updated":"20251031163149"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原理：在两帧之间会额外做 运动轨迹的扫掠检测（sweep test），以减少穿透"}]},{"ID":"20251031163149-aqf9toi","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251031163149-aqf9toi","updated":"20251031163149"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031163150-0p2uoe6","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251031163150-0p2uoe6","updated":"20251031163150"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031163150-tue2bov","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251031163150-tue2bov","updated":"20251031163150"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"优点：大幅降低高速物体穿透的概率"}]}]},{"ID":"20251031163151-6e2a2fa","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251031163151-6e2a2fa","updated":"20251031163151"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031163151-bu1q5hi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251031163151-bu1q5hi","updated":"20251031163151"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"缺点：CPU 开销比 Discrete 高"}]}]},{"ID":"20251031163151-dz6r1oz","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251031163151-dz6r1oz","updated":"20251031163151"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031163151-qy5v83m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251031163151-qy5v83m","updated":"20251031163151"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"适用场景：非主角的小型高速物体（例如子弹、飞镖、投射物）"}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251031163137-7dbo35q","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251031163137-7dbo35q","updated":"20251031163137"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031163025-krc9mk4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251031163025-krc9mk4","updated":"20251031163025"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Continuous Dynamic（连续动态检测）"}]},{"ID":"20251031163157-sq714zz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251031163157-sq714zz","updated":"20251031163207"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原理：比 Continuous（连续检测） 更严格，专门用于高速移动的刚体，\n它会检测所有 Continuous （连续检测）、Continuous Dynamic （连续动态检测）的物体"}]},{"ID":"20251031163158-cs3na56","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251031163158-cs3na56","updated":"20251031163158"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031163159-sx615yx","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251031163159-sx615yx","updated":"20251031163159"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031163159-2uou1bt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251031163159-2uou1bt","updated":"20251031163159"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"优点：最稳妥地避免穿透"}]}]},{"ID":"20251031163159-c2m5aqj","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251031163159-c2m5aqj","updated":"20251031163159"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031163159-6hqehn4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251031163159-6hqehn4","updated":"20251031163159"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"缺点：开销最高，不适合大规模使用"}]}]},{"ID":"20251031163200-o4unnml","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251031163200-o4unnml","updated":"20251031163200"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031163200-l86gzma","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251031163200-l86gzma","updated":"20251031163200"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"适用场景：关键的高速动态物体（例如主角手里的高速挥舞武器、主角发射的重要投射物）"}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251031163137-vldk1om","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251031163137-vldk1om","updated":"20251031163137"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031163025-fgfbvks","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251031163025-fgfbvks","updated":"20251031163222"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Continuous Speculative（连续推测式检测）\n"}]},{"ID":"20251031163225-h7136yt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251031163225-h7136yt","updated":"20251031163225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原理：一种相对新的模式（比 Continuous（连续检测） 更轻量），会在下一帧前预测可能的碰撞，即使物体很小很快，也能避免大多数穿透"}]},{"ID":"20251031163214-7zcfxgh","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251031163214-7zcfxgh","updated":"20251031163214"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031163213-alnaq5y","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251031163213-alnaq5y","updated":"20251031163213"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031163213-jtytbig","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251031163213-jtytbig","updated":"20251031163213"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"优点：比 Continuous Dynamic（连续动态检测） 更省性能；避免了很多小物体穿透"}]}]},{"ID":"20251031163215-1djpdfc","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251031163215-1djpdfc","updated":"20251031163215"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031163215-at417ch","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251031163215-at417ch","updated":"20251031163215"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"缺点：推测结果可能带来误判（没撞上也认为撞上了），偶尔出现虚假碰撞"}]}]},{"ID":"20251031163215-hajngl2","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251031163215-hajngl2","updated":"20251031163215"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031163215-09kll9b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"fold":"1","heading-fold":"1","id":"20251031163215-09kll9b","updated":"20251031163215"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"适用场景：中高速物体，既需要避免穿透，又不想消耗太多性能的情况"}]}]}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251031172326-yqukqj3","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251031172326-yqukqj3","updated":"20251031172443"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本章代码关键字"}]},{"ID":"20251031172333-zfng88m","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20251031172333-zfng88m","updated":"20251031172443"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"YyM="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"rigidbody.solverIterations\t\t\t\t// 单独设置该刚体对象解算器迭代次数，影响位置、旋转精度和稳定性\nrigidbody.solverVelocityIterations\t\t// 单独设置该刚体对象解算器速度迭代次数，影响摩擦、反弹的稳定性\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]},{"ID":"20251031170734-otavy20","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251031170734-otavy20","updated":"20251031170934"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"首选离散碰撞检测"}]},{"ID":"20251031170832-2qgab11","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031170832-2qgab11","updated":"20251031170923"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果你的项目是一个物理类型的项目，对于刚体中 Collision Detection（碰撞检测）参数"}]},{"ID":"20251031170900-x5pe6vc","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251031170900-x5pe6vc","updated":"20251031170920"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031170900-yet75xq","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251031170900-yet75xq","updated":"20251031170900"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031170900-d39zh44","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031170900-d39zh44","updated":"20251031170902"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"应该首选 Discrete（离散检测），因为它的性能消耗最低"}]}]},{"ID":"20251031170900-8wg4czt","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251031170900-8wg4czt","updated":"20251031170900"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031170900-gs72cc8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031170900-gs72cc8","updated":"20251031170905"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"少数高速投射物（比如子弹、飞镖），用 Continuous（连续）"}]}]},{"ID":"20251031170900-zkmn0vn","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20251031170900-zkmn0vn","updated":"20251031170900"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031170900-jvurr4j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031170900-jvurr4j","updated":"20251031170908"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"关键高速动态物体（例如 Boss 的大锤、主角飞行体），用 Continuous Dynamic（连续动态）"}]}]},{"ID":"20251031170900-muaryvx","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20251031170900-muaryvx","updated":"20251031170920"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031170900-k0x0iq4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031170900-k0x0iq4","updated":"20251031170920"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"兼顾性能与准确性，可尝试 Continuous Speculative（连续推测式），但要注意误判问题"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251031170832-4yejpfy","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20251031170832-4yejpfy","style":"background-color: var(--b3-card-warning-background); color: var(--b3-card-warning-color); --b3-parent-background: var(--b3-card-warning-background);","updated":"20251031170843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20251031170843-l579qu5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031170843-l579qu5","updated":"20251031170843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意："}]},{"ID":"20251031170845-7275bys","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{},"Properties":{"id":"20251031170845-7275bys","updated":"20251031170848"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031170848-4x1hq3k","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251031170848-4x1hq3k","updated":"20251031170848"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031170848-xtf2nuk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031170848-xtf2nuk","updated":"20251031170848"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在游戏开发时，建议非物理类游戏 都不要使用刚体和碰撞器来进行碰撞检测"}]}]},{"ID":"20251031170849-f7c9q6a","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"BulletChar":42,"Marker":"Kg=="},"Properties":{"id":"20251031170849-f7c9q6a","updated":"20251031170849"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031170849-wbb1nct","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031170849-wbb1nct","updated":"20251031170849"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在大部分商业游戏中，战斗系统的伤害检测，往往使用 射线检测、范围检测 或 自己实现检测逻辑"}]}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251031170934-c0tf9ih","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251031170934-c0tf9ih","updated":"20251031172358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"解算器迭代次数"}]},{"ID":"20251031170940-gihkozz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031170940-gihkozz","updated":"20251031170951"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们之前在讲解物理系统基础设置时，提到了解算器迭代次数\n其实除了在基础设置中进行全局迭代次数设置\n我们还可以利用刚体中的参数设置单个对象的迭代次数"}]},{"ID":"20251031170951-q8pkdk2","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251031170951-q8pkdk2","updated":"20251031172358"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031170951-ndh7zr4","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251031170951-ndh7zr4","name":"rigidbody.solverIterations","updated":"20251031172241"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031170951-bge3547","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031170951-bge3547","updated":"20251031171013"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"solverIterations"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20251031170952-dhce3l8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031170952-dhce3l8","updated":"20251031170955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"设置该对象解算器迭代次数，影响位置、旋转精度和稳定性"}]},{"ID":"20251031170956-edu56t4","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20251031170956-edu56t4","updated":"20251031172241"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"YyM="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"rigidbody.solverIterations = 8;\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]}]},{"ID":"20251031170951-eq74mac","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251031170951-eq74mac","name":"rigidbody.solverVelocityIterations","updated":"20251031172358"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031170951-r8ja8hu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031170951-r8ja8hu","updated":"20251031171016"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"solverVelocityIterations"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20251031171009-lsmdzuf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031171009-lsmdzuf","updated":"20251031171009"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"设置该对象解算器速度迭代次数，影响摩擦、反弹的稳定性"}]},{"ID":"20251031171004-p1y0hu4","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"Properties":{"id":"20251031171004-p1y0hu4","updated":"20251031172358"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"YyM="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"rigidbody.solverVelocityIterations = 2;\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251031170940-3quf5wl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031170940-3quf5wl","updated":"20251031171024"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对于解算器的优化思路就是"}]},{"ID":"20251031171024-1a5n9sr","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251031171024-1a5n9sr","updated":"20251031172148"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031171024-n42dwg3","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251031171024-n42dwg3","updated":"20251031172148"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031171024-khgvxg1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031171024-khgvxg1","updated":"20251031172148"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"将 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20251009111956-zwjvhd1","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"全局解算器相关设置"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 到一个较低的基线（比如 4/1，6/1）"}]}]},{"ID":"20251031171024-57bffxq","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251031171024-57bffxq","updated":"20251031171024"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031171024-7maw6pp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031171024-7maw6pp","updated":"20251031171024"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对个别需要稳定的刚体（主角、载具）利用刚体参数局部上调"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251031170940-egjedpq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031170940-egjedpq","updated":"20251031171034"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"不要因为个别对象物理表现的不稳定而去调整全局的解算器迭代次数，那样会增加所有对象物理计算的开销！"}]},{"ID":"20251031171122-frfifv7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251031171122-frfifv7","updated":"20251031171721"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"刚体相关 API 在 FixedUpdate 中调用"}]},{"ID":"20251031171430-ilgxsp5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031171430-ilgxsp5","updated":"20251031171527"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"物理相关逻辑用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code block-ref","TextMarkBlockRefID":"20230708150925-wqb083p","TextMarkBlockRefSubtype":"s","TextMarkTextContent":"FixedUpdate"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 进行处理，特别是在移动刚体对象时\n应尽量使用刚体中的 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"MovePosition"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 和 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"MoveRotation"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"AddForce"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 和改 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"velocity"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 相关API\n千万不要在 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Update"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 中直接修改刚体对象的 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Transform"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​，这会增加性能开销"}]},{"ID":"20251031171430-26vof6r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031171430-26vof6r","updated":"20251031171539"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原因：\n如果在 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Update"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 中通过修改刚体对象的 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Transform"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 修改对象位置角度等，\n相当于绕过了物理系统的运动学路径，引擎不得不做额外的强制同步和状态修复"}]},{"ID":"20251031171430-4uftj8r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031171430-4uftj8r","updated":"20251031171555"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Unity 中物理的基本运行逻辑是："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"FixedUpdate"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ → 物理世界更新 → "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Rigidbody"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 位置、旋转被写回 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Transform"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20251031171430-mlw2vik","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031171430-mlw2vik","updated":"20251031171601"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"当你在 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Update"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 里直接改 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Transform"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 时会造成以下问题"}]},{"ID":"20251031171605-pg4zhsq","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251031171605-pg4zhsq","updated":"20251031171706"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031171614-6z2en46","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251031171614-6z2en46","updated":"20251031171706"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031171614-z1n5iuj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031171614-z1n5iuj","updated":"20251031171618"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"破坏物理世界与 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Transform"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 的一致性"}]},{"ID":"20251031171615-gqp77h6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031171615-gqp77h6","updated":"20251031171706"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Rigidbody"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 的物理状态（位置、速度、加速度、接触点等）和你直接改的 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"Transform"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​ 脱节，Unity 必须在下一次物理更新时发现这种不一致并修正"}]}]},{"ID":"20251031171614-0uxrrzx","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251031171614-0uxrrzx","updated":"20251031171614"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031171614-ovufslo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031171614-ovufslo","updated":"20251031171631"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"强制触发物理同步"}]},{"ID":"20251031171634-8jdo04j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031171634-8jdo04j","updated":"20251031171634"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Unity 会把刚体视作瞬间传送到新位置，这会让引擎重新计算 碰撞体包围盒（AABB）、更新 Broadphase（物体空间划分结构，如四叉树/八叉树/动态 BVH）\n丢弃上一帧的速度、动量，接触点全部失效，需要重新生成"}]}]},{"ID":"20251031171614-virhn4h","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20251031171614-virhn4h","updated":"20251031171614"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031171614-gey26i7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031171614-gey26i7","updated":"20251031171614"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"昂贵的接触点重建"}]},{"ID":"20251031171649-00g2hzr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031171649-00g2hzr","updated":"20251031171657"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原本只需做 连续碰撞检测 + 轻量接触 更新，现在要从零开始做 Broadphase → Narrowphase → 新的接触点解算\n如果重建的物体多，会造成 CPU 峰值开销"}]}]},{"ID":"20251031171614-qpfmzp8","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20251031171614-qpfmzp8","updated":"20251031171614"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031171614-zt1vt7x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031171614-zt1vt7x","updated":"20251031171614"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"丢失物理连续性"}]},{"ID":"20251031171659-39rt2lr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031171659-39rt2lr","updated":"20251031171659"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因为是瞬移，物理不会计算中间路径、高速穿透检测全部失效"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251031171721-5vr95bz","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20251031171721-5vr95bz","updated":"20251031172635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"岛屿相关"}]},{"ID":"20251031171735-353ihyj","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20251031171735-353ihyj","updated":"20251031172632"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"物理引擎中岛屿的概念"}]},{"ID":"20251031171830-58f3xmv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031171830-58f3xmv","updated":"20251031171832"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在物理引擎（比如 Unity 底层的 PhysX）里刚体之间，如果通过碰撞接触点（Contacts）或关节（Joints）相连，就会被分到同一个岛屿\n每个岛屿是一个独立的连通子系统，内部的刚体相互作用，但与其他岛屿无关"}]},{"ID":"20251031171749-munogj3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031171749-munogj3","updated":"20251031171820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"举例："}]},{"ID":"20251031171820-dzdqmf1","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251031171820-dzdqmf1","updated":"20251031171820"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031171820-hfeksuo","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251031171820-hfeksuo","updated":"20251031171820"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031171820-7p5ym2x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031171820-7p5ym2x","updated":"20251031171820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"地上有一堆接触在一起的箱子，那么箱子们和地面就形成一个岛屿"}]}]},{"ID":"20251031171820-4d1vkbd","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251031171820-4d1vkbd","updated":"20251031171820"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031171820-dcy1scf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031171820-dcy1scf","updated":"20251031171820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"天空里独立漂浮的球，这个球就是单独的一个岛屿"}]}]},{"ID":"20251031171820-vulr8u8","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20251031171820-vulr8u8","updated":"20251031171820"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031171820-k7b7yej","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031171820-k7b7yej","updated":"20251031171820"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"远处另一堆完全不接触的物体，它们是另一个岛屿"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251031171735-zr6x5l0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031171735-zr6x5l0","updated":"20251031171912"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为什么有岛屿的概念："}]},{"ID":"20251031171838-ccwm7pt","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251031171838-ccwm7pt","updated":"20251031171842"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031171842-5ycr5jr","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251031171842-5ycr5jr","updated":"20251031171842"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031171842-3no9wpj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031171842-3no9wpj","updated":"20251031171842"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为了性能优化"}]},{"ID":"20251031171844-lbc7uee","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031171844-lbc7uee","updated":"20251031171848"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"岛屿之间完全独立，解算时可以分开算，甚至多线程并行，相当于每个岛屿都是一个独立的解算单元\n引擎会逐岛屿进行刚体运动学解算，岛屿之间互不干扰，它是一种解算时的分治结构"}]}]},{"ID":"20251031171842-vpg6lyz","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251031171842-vpg6lyz","updated":"20251031171842"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031171842-7guagv4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031171842-7guagv4","updated":"20251031171842"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为了休眠管理"}]},{"ID":"20251031171907-lsy2cdf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031171907-lsy2cdf","updated":"20251031171907"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"引擎以岛屿为单位判断是否可以休眠，从而批量降低 CPU 开销"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251031171735-xnpo96d","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20251031171735-xnpo96d","updated":"20251031172750"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"岛屿效应"}]},{"ID":"20251031171926-y188a1x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031171926-y188a1x","updated":"20251031171926"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果一个岛屿里的 所有刚体都满足休眠条件（速度低于阈值并保持一段时间），则整个岛屿会休眠，这样可以节省性能\n但是如果岛屿里 有一个刚体被唤醒（比如施加了力、被碰撞撞到、Transform 被改动），则整个岛屿都会被唤醒\n这就是所谓的 岛屿效应，相当于 一荣俱荣，一损俱损"}]},{"ID":"20251031171735-qvgw2mp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031171735-qvgw2mp","updated":"20251031171933"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"可能带来的性能风险"}]},{"ID":"20251031171933-hej5r9r","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251031171933-hej5r9r","updated":"20251031171933"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031171933-x8revfg","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251031171933-x8revfg","updated":"20251031171933"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031171933-knmvq0t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031171933-knmvq0t","updated":"20251031171933"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大型链条、布娃娃"}]},{"ID":"20251031171934-shh7ogz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031171934-shh7ogz","updated":"20251031171934"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果一个关节还在晃动，整条链都会醒着，CPU 会一直算"}]}]},{"ID":"20251031171933-afn1qio","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251031171933-afn1qio","updated":"20251031171933"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031171933-wojj8j5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031171933-wojj8j5","updated":"20251031171933"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"成堆的物体"}]},{"ID":"20251031171935-4aetr4g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031171935-4aetr4g","updated":"20251031171935"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"玩家踢动一个箱子，整堆箱子都醒了，计算量会突增"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251031171735-o6ffsc8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031171735-o6ffsc8","updated":"20251031171942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"优化方向"}]},{"ID":"20251031171942-jf5umo3","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251031171942-jf5umo3","updated":"20251031171955"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031171942-ga2ga19","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20251031171942-ga2ga19","updated":"20251031171942"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031171942-3edb4od","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031171942-3edb4od","updated":"20251031171942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"避免无效的关节绑定，不要把不必要的刚体用关节绑定"}]}]},{"ID":"20251031171942-mvopv1h","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20251031171942-mvopv1h","updated":"20251031171942"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031171942-gjynmqk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031171942-gjynmqk","updated":"20251031171942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"能做成一个刚体+多个子碰撞体的，就不要做成N个独立刚体互相堆叠"}]}]},{"ID":"20251031171942-t6bmxx9","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20251031171942-t6bmxx9","updated":"20251031171942"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031171942-ogd1rk0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031171942-ogd1rk0","updated":"20251031171942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"利用碰撞层矩阵过滤，避免无效碰撞"}]}]},{"ID":"20251031171942-wa7jqln","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20251031171942-wa7jqln","updated":"20251031171955"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031171942-k88zaaa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031171942-k88zaaa","updated":"20251031171942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"使用关节时，将不受到力传导的连接点换成运动学刚体，利用位移或者动画来驱动"}]},{"ID":"20251031171953-zf25evf","Type":"NodeBlockquote","Properties":{"id":"20251031171953-zf25evf","style":"background-color: var(--b3-card-warning-background); color: var(--b3-card-warning-color); --b3-parent-background: var(--b3-card-warning-background);","updated":"20251031171955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBlockquoteMarker","Data":"\u003e"},{"ID":"20251031171955-5vepnfv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031171955-5vepnfv","updated":"20251031171955"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意：运动学刚体不被力学解算，它可以有效的将岛屿切断为两部分，特别是关节链条中"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251031171942-pfbpqpx","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"NS4=","Num":5},"Properties":{"id":"20251031171942-pfbpqpx","updated":"20251031171942"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031171942-r34emoh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031171942-r34emoh","updated":"20251031171942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在物理系统基础设置中的 适当提高休眠阈值、反弹阈值等等参数，让对象物理表现不那么敏感"}]}]},{"ID":"20251031171942-0025mz5","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Ni4=","Num":6},"Properties":{"id":"20251031171942-0025mz5","updated":"20251031171942"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031171942-ubepg9z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031171942-ubepg9z","updated":"20251031171942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"减少动态碰撞体，能用静态碰撞体的就用静态碰撞体"}]}]},{"ID":"20251031171942-59aea3z","Type":"NodeListItem","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Delimiter":46,"Marker":"Ny4=","Num":7},"Properties":{"id":"20251031171942-59aea3z","updated":"20251031171942"},"Children":[{"ID":"20251031171942-0aohi0l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031171942-0aohi0l","updated":"20251031171942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"减少关节、布娃娃系统的使用"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20251031171938-9tk634c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031171938-9tk634c","updated":"20251031171938"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等等"}]},{"ID":"20251031172750-0ssk367","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20251031172750-0ssk367","updated":"20251031172750"}}]}